hat horrifying incident in Ukishima Province. What sort of \"experiment\" is Fumito and \"Tower\" trying to conduct using the Old Ones? And can Saya finally deliver vengeance to Fumito?\n\nNow, the final battle begins...\n\n(Source: Official site)"},"tags":[{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Vampire","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Monster Girl","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Power","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crossover","rank":70,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Revenge","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Guns","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":48,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Assassins","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kaiju","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Yuri","rank":13,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"BLOOD-C: The Last Dark","english":"BLOOD-C: The Last Dark","native":"劇場版 BLOOD-C The Last Dark","romaji":"BLOOD-C: The Last Dark","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"BLOOD-C The Last Dark"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}